    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "manifesto"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "For those who want to go further"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Imagination has no ceiling.<br>Neither does Caresse."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Many couples share desires they've never dared to voice out loud. Caresse creates the space to explore them — a voice that carries the narrative without judgment, without pressure, at the intensity you choose."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "manifesto-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "manifesto-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">The usual barrier</p>\n                \n                <p>Some desires stay in the mind because you don't know how to suggest them without awkwardness or fear of the other's reaction.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "manifesto-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">What Caresse changes</p>\n                \n                <p>You configure your fantasies together in the app. The AI weaves them into a coherent session with rhythm and tension. Nobody has to \"suggest\" anything directly.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "manifesto-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">The freedom it creates</p>\n                \n                <p>When the voice says things, you can let go without wondering if the other is comfortable. You already decided that together, beforehand.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "manifesto-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">The boundary that always stays</p>\n                \n                <p>Caresse only generates what you've authorized. Boundaries are defined by you, not by the app. Boldness stays in your hands.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
