            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "What Caresse brings"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "An experience that matches your appetite."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Adventurous couples have often already tried everything. What they've never had is an AI that creates the unprecedented on demand."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎭</div>\n                \n                <h3>Roleplay without scripting effort</h3>\n                \n                <p>You choose the dynamic — dominance, submission, equality, role-play — and Caresse builds the narrative. No improvising needed; the voice carries everything.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔥</div>\n                \n                <h3>Fantasies put into words</h3>\n                \n                <p>Some desires are hard to express directly. Caresse receives them in configuration and translates them into audio experience — without anyone having to \"confess\" them to the other.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🌀</div>\n                \n                <h3>Every session is a first</h3>\n                \n                <p>The AI generates on the fly. Even with the same preferences, you'll never hear the same session twice. Exploration has no bottom.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🛡️</div>\n                \n                <h3>Your limits, your frame</h3>\n                \n                <p>Boldness doesn't mean framelessness. Caresse generates only within the parameters you've set together. The AI respects exactly what you tell it.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
