              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n                \n                <h3>Define your limits</h3>\n                \n                <p>Together, browse the options: intensity, dynamics, themes, content type. It's already an honest conversation about what you truly want.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n                \n                <h3>The AI creates your session</h3>\n                \n                <p>In minutes, Caresse generates a tailored audio experience — unprecedented, coherent, with the narrative tension that matches your preferences.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">03</div>\n                \n                <h3>Put down the phone</h3>\n                \n                <p>Speaker or bluetooth. The voice fills the room; your hands and attention are completely free.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">04</div>\n                \n                <h3>Enter the experience</h3>\n                \n                <p>The voice leads. The story unfolds. There's nothing to manage — just let yourself be taken where you asked to go.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
